ted execution on site.","availableServices":"$3a:props:children:props:children:props:locations:0:availableServices","faqs":[{"q":"Do you take up single-room projects in Kurnool?","a":"Yes. We handle individual rooms such as a modular kitchen or bedroom wardrobes, as well as complete homes."},{"q":"How do I book a consultation?","a":"Call or WhatsApp us, or use the enquiry form on this page. We'll get back to you to plan the next steps."}],"active":true},{"slug":"nandyal","city":"Nandyal","state":"Andhra Pradesh","region":"Rayalaseema","intro":"Thoughtfully designed interiors for homes in Nandyal.","coverImage":"/assets/locations/nandyal.webp","coverCaption":"Mahanandi Temple, Nandyal district","coverCredit":{"author":"Adityamadhav83","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mahanandi_Temple_View.jpg"},"description":"Planning a new home or renovating an existing one in Nandyal? We help you design functional, elegant spaces and manage execution from material selection to handover.","availableServices":"$3a:props:children:props:children:props:locations:0:availableServices","faqs":[{"q":"Do you serve customers in Nandyal?","a":"Yes. We serve Nandyal and the surrounding towns, along with the rest of Andhra Pradesh and Hyderabad."},{"q":"Can you work with an under-construction home?","a":"Yes. Planning interiors early helps coordinate electrical points, lighting and ceiling work. Contact us to discuss your project stage."}],"active":true},{"slug":"hyderabad","city":"Hyderabad","state":"Telangana","region":"Telangana","intro":"Complete home interiors and modular kitchens in Hyderabad.","coverImage":"/assets/locations/hyderabad.webp","coverCaption":"Buddha Statue, Hussain Sagar","coverCredit":{"author":"Nikhilb239","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hussain_Sagar_Buddha_Sta